From b17134865b151d1fe1373f539e0c53796f92f129 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:00:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] test-posix: Check getgrent, setgrent and endgrent, and
 the shared parser

getgrent leaves errno alone at the end and setgrent and endgrent
rewind and close without touching errno. fgetgrent and fgetgrent_r
(extensions) show how lines are parsed: malformed ones skipped, 32-bit
ids, an empty member field, a group with many members, and ERANGE
leaving the entry to be read again.
---
